WEBVTT

1
00:01:12.458 --> 00:01:14.708
After discussing the forms of faith

2
00:01:14.708 --> 00:01:18.541
and worship shaped by the three gunas, now

3
00:01:18.541 --> 00:01:22.375
in verses 17.7 to 17.10 of Chapter 17,

4
00:01:22.375 --> 00:01:23.083
Lord Krishna

5
00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:23.708
describes the

6
00:01:23.708 --> 00:01:27.541
everyday expressions of faith – food,

7
00:01:27.541 --> 00:01:31.458
sacrifice, charity, and austerity.

8
00:01:31.458 --> 00:01:35.250
These actions do not only tell us what we do,

9
00:01:35.250 --> 00:01:37.833
but also reveal

10
00:01:37.833 --> 00:01:40.833
who we really are.

11
00:01:40.833 --> 00:01:42.666
Food in particular

12
00:01:42.666 --> 00:01:45.625
becomes a direct mirror of the subtle

13
00:01:45.625 --> 00:01:46.583
inner qualities

14
00:01:46.583 --> 00:01:48.041
that influence our mind

15
00:01:48.041 --> 00:01:50.250
and consciousness.

16
00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:51.958
In these verses, Lord Krishna

17
00:01:51.958 --> 00:01:53.541
explains the types of food

18
00:01:53.541 --> 00:01:56.333
according to the three gunas.

19
00:02:01.083 --> 00:02:02.666
Lord Krishna explains

20
00:02:02.666 --> 00:02:06.291
that food too is influenced by the three gunas –

21
00:02:06.291 --> 00:02:09.708
sattvic, rajasic, and tamasic.

22
00:02:09.708 --> 00:02:11.250
What we eat,

23
00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:13.166
how it is cooked,

24
00:02:13.166 --> 00:02:15.458
and when it is taken –

25
00:02:15.458 --> 00:02:19.500
all these show the level of our consciousness.

26
00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:23.041
Sattvic food is clean, nourishing, full of

27
00:02:23.041 --> 00:02:26.416
freshness, and cooked with affection.

28
00:02:26.416 --> 00:02:30.250
It increases lifespan and mental clarity,

29
00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:32.291
makes the body healthy,

30
00:02:32.291 --> 00:02:34.833
and gives contentment to the mind.

31
00:02:34.833 --> 00:02:37.625
Juicy fruits, ripened grains,

32
00:02:37.625 --> 00:02:40.708
vegetables, and milk-based foods –

33
00:02:40.708 --> 00:02:42.583
when made with love

34
00:02:42.583 --> 00:02:45.041
and offered to the Lord –

35
00:02:45.041 --> 00:02:47.750
naturally lift the mind higher

36
00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:51.000
and purify the thoughts.

37
00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:52.208
Such food

38
00:02:52.208 --> 00:02:56.583
gives energy to the body and peace to the heart.

39
00:02:56.583 --> 00:03:00.125
Rajasic food is excessively spicy,

40
00:03:00.125 --> 00:03:03.625
salty, hot, or sour.

41
00:03:03.625 --> 00:03:06.291
It excites the senses,

42
00:03:06.291 --> 00:03:08.833
but does not give balance.

43
00:03:08.833 --> 00:03:13.000
The craving for enjoyment increases,
but satisfaction is not found.

44
00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:15.875
Such food gives momentary thrill,

45
00:03:15.875 --> 00:03:20.000
but slowly spoils digestion, brings fatigue,

46
00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:21.666
and increases disease.

47
00:03:21.666 --> 00:03:24.333
Its intensity and aggressiveness reflect

48
00:03:24.333 --> 00:03:28.791
the restlessness of a mind influenced
by rajo-guna.

49
00:03:28.791 --> 00:03:34.000
Tamasic food is stale, tasteless, rotten,

50
00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:35.875
improperly cooked,

51
00:03:35.875 --> 00:03:38.875
or the leftover food of others.

52
00:03:38.875 --> 00:03:44.125
It dulls the mind and reduces energy.

53
00:03:44.125 --> 00:03:47.916
Such food appeals to those who
are careless toward health

54
00:03:47.916 --> 00:03:51.458
and spirituality, and who

55
00:03:51.458 --> 00:03:55.250
value convenience over awareness.

56
00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:59.000
Here Lord Krishna uses the word ‘amedhya,’

57
00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:00.541
which means

58
00:04:00.541 --> 00:04:03.291
impure – that which is not fit to be offered

59
00:04:03.291 --> 00:04:04.583
in sacrifice.

60
00:04:04.583 --> 00:04:06.583
Yet even sattvic

61
00:04:06.583 --> 00:04:08.500
food alone is not enough.

62
00:04:08.500 --> 00:04:11.583
Until food is offered to the Lord,

63
00:04:11.583 --> 00:04:14.458
it too remains within the bondage of karma.

64
00:04:14.458 --> 00:04:17.500
Food truly becomes spiritual

65
00:04:17.500 --> 00:04:19.875
only when it is cooked with love

66
00:04:19.875 --> 00:04:22.916
and offered with faith to Lord Krishna.

67
00:04:22.916 --> 00:04:25.541
Such food is called prasad –

68
00:04:25.541 --> 00:04:27.250
which is beyond the gunas,

69
00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:30.833
nourishes both body and soul,

70
00:04:30.833 --> 00:04:32.541
cuts the bondage of karma,

71
00:04:32.541 --> 00:04:34.375
purifies the soul,

72
00:04:34.375 --> 00:04:37.791
and gives divine joy to the senses.

73
00:04:37.791 --> 00:04:40.416
In this way, the food we eat

74
00:04:40.416 --> 00:04:43.041
becomes the very reflection of our life, thoughts,

75
00:04:43.041 --> 00:04:46.166
and conduct.

76
00:04:51.083 --> 00:04:53.041
You may think

77
00:04:53.041 --> 00:04:56.000
that you simply like certain dishes –

78
00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:59.291
intensely spicy foods, oily

79
00:04:59.291 --> 00:05:02.416
preparations, or leftover food.

80
00:05:02.416 --> 00:05:06.625
But remember – this is not only taste,

81
00:05:06.625 --> 00:05:10.916
it is a reflection of the quality of
your inner being.

82
00:05:10.916 --> 00:05:13.458
If you are in rajas,

83
00:05:13.458 --> 00:05:16.291
you will be drawn toward food

84
00:05:16.291 --> 00:05:18.041
that gives excitement, but

85
00:05:18.041 --> 00:05:20.250
destroys energy.

86
00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:23.375
If you are in tamas, you will choose food

87
00:05:23.375 --> 00:05:26.750
that brings dullness and inertia.

88
00:05:26.750 --> 00:05:29.208
And if you are in sattva,

89
00:05:29.208 --> 00:05:32.083
you will naturally want the food

90
00:05:32.083 --> 00:05:35.875
that gives peace, clarity, and nourishment.

91
00:05:35.875 --> 00:05:39.208
But this process works both ways –

92
00:05:39.208 --> 00:05:42.166
what you eat also shapes your thoughts

93
00:05:42.166 --> 00:05:45.750
and experiences.

94
00:05:45.750 --> 00:05:47.708
Regular rajasic food

95
00:05:47.708 --> 00:05:51.166
makes you restless.

96
00:05:51.166 --> 00:05:56.291
Tamasic food increases laziness and heaviness.

97
00:05:56.291 --> 00:06:00.375
This is why I say – the gunas shape
not only your mind

98
00:06:00.375 --> 00:06:04.750
and actions, but your food as well.

99
00:06:04.750 --> 00:06:07.000
Look around you –

100
00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:07.958
illnesses,

101
00:06:07.958 --> 00:06:08.625
anxiety,

102
00:06:08.625 --> 00:06:10.375
and restlessness often

103
00:06:10.375 --> 00:06:12.416
increase from the very food that

104
00:06:12.416 --> 00:06:13.291
people, influenced

105
00:06:13.291 --> 00:06:15.375
by rajas and tamas,

106
00:06:15.375 --> 00:06:18.208
consider to be the best.

107
00:06:18.208 --> 00:06:21.375
These verses are not only theory –

108
00:06:21.375 --> 00:06:24.458
they are your everyday reality.

109
00:06:24.458 --> 00:06:28.083
Make them the foundation of your
faith in the Gita –

110
00:06:28.083 --> 00:06:30.666
not only as scripture, but

111
00:06:30.666 --> 00:06:31.958
as a truth

112
00:06:31.958 --> 00:06:34.958
you can see for yourself.

113
00:06:34.958 --> 00:06:36.333
Understand –

114
00:06:36.333 --> 00:06:39.583
as is the food, so is the mind!

115
00:06:44.541 --> 00:06:46.416
Think –

116
00:06:46.416 --> 00:06:48.791
what are you feeding your family

117
00:06:48.791 --> 00:06:50.791
every day?

118
00:06:50.791 --> 00:06:53.833
Because what goes into the body slowly

119
00:06:53.833 --> 00:06:55.708
shapes the mind.

120
00:06:55.708 --> 00:06:59.875
The kitchen is not only a place to cook dishes –

121
00:06:59.875 --> 00:07:03.041
it is the building-place of consciousness.

122
00:07:03.041 --> 00:07:07.250
If there is sattva in your food –

123
00:07:07.250 --> 00:07:10.291
freshness, gratitude, and devotion –

124
00:07:10.291 --> 00:07:12.083
then your family's mind

125
00:07:12.083 --> 00:07:15.375
will reflect that same peace.

126
00:07:15.375 --> 00:07:19.166
But if the kitchen becomes a centre
of disorder, indulgence,

127
00:07:19.166 --> 00:07:21.916
or carelessness,

128
00:07:21.916 --> 00:07:23.583
then do not be surprised

129
00:07:23.583 --> 00:07:27.083
if restlessness and dullness enter the home.

130
00:07:27.083 --> 00:07:31.666
When the food packed for school-going children

131
00:07:31.666 --> 00:07:35.000
is homemade and fresh,

132
00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:38.125
its good effect is clearly visible.

133
00:07:38.125 --> 00:07:39.666
Market-made food items

134
00:07:39.666 --> 00:07:42.750
harm not only a child's physical health,

135
00:07:42.750 --> 00:07:46.916
but also their mental capacity.

136
00:07:46.916 --> 00:07:52.125
Remember – thoughts too are cooked
along with the food.

137
00:07:52.125 --> 00:07:56.750
When you take care of the kitchen,
you will automatically begin to take care

138
00:07:56.750 --> 00:08:01.875
of your emotions, energy, and relationships too.

139
00:08:01.916 --> 00:08:04.625
And remember this truth –

140
00:08:04.625 --> 00:08:07.708
food that arises from pain,

141
00:08:07.708 --> 00:08:11.083
whether from violence or from ego –

142
00:08:11.083 --> 00:08:15.000
never gives lasting happiness.

143
00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:17.833
Make your kitchen a temple.

144
00:08:17.833 --> 00:08:19.916
Keep the ingredients pure,

145
00:08:19.916 --> 00:08:23.916
and keep the heart calm while cooking.

146
00:08:23.916 --> 00:08:31.541
This alone can transform your
family's thoughts, emotions, and life.

147
00:08:36.125 --> 00:08:39.875
Perhaps you do not connect your lunchbox

148
00:08:39.875 --> 00:08:43.583
with your leadership ability –

149
00:08:43.583 --> 00:08:46.291
but I do.

150
00:08:46.291 --> 00:08:48.916
Food does not only fill the stomach;

151
00:08:48.916 --> 00:08:51.833
it also gives energy to your thoughts.

152
00:08:51.833 --> 00:08:53.875
Intensely spicy,

153
00:08:53.875 --> 00:08:57.291
oily, or market-made food

154
00:08:57.291 --> 00:09:01.458
may give a momentary excitement, but soon

155
00:09:01.458 --> 00:09:03.791
it makes the mind restless,

156
00:09:03.791 --> 00:09:05.750
the energy scattered,

157
00:09:05.750 --> 00:09:08.125
and the focus dull.

158
00:09:08.125 --> 00:09:10.875
In business meetings or late-night dinners,

159
00:09:10.875 --> 00:09:15.208
those who, in the name of
making professional contacts,

160
00:09:15.208 --> 00:09:17.250
consider drinking alcohol a sign of modernity,

161
00:09:17.250 --> 00:09:20.750
pay the price of these achievements
with serious health problems.

162
00:09:20.750 --> 00:09:22.000
When life itself

163
00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:26.208
will not remain, then of what use is wealth?

164
00:09:26.208 --> 00:09:30.583
Slowly this becomes your normal condition –

165
00:09:30.583 --> 00:09:32.250
decisions made in haste,

166
00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:36.000
meetings filled with agitation, and a tired mind

167
00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:40.208
that cannot think clearly.

168
00:09:40.208 --> 00:09:44.208
You may call it stress, but many times

169
00:09:44.208 --> 00:09:46.041
your plate is speaking in a louder

170
00:09:46.041 --> 00:09:49.666
voice than even your thinking.

171
00:09:49.666 --> 00:09:53.250
On the contrary, sattvic food –

172
00:09:53.250 --> 00:09:56.041
light, clean, fresh,

173
00:09:56.041 --> 00:09:58.833
and nourishing –

174
00:09:58.833 --> 00:10:01.875
calms your body

175
00:10:01.875 --> 00:10:04.916
and helps in deep thinking, steady emotions,

176
00:10:04.916 --> 00:10:09.125
and wise choices.

177
00:10:09.125 --> 00:10:13.250
Transformation begins with a small choice.

178
00:10:13.250 --> 00:10:17.375
And sometimes the most spiritual
decision at the workplace

179
00:10:17.375 --> 00:10:20.750
is just this –

180
00:10:20.750 --> 00:10:25.375
what you eat and how you eat!
